00:34:01.506 --> 00:34:02.707
it, it was...

00:34:02.707 --> 00:34:03.941
Yeah, it was after
Sandy Hook, for sure.

00:34:03.941 --> 00:34:05.476
- Yeah, well, I know it
was after Sandy Hook,

00:34:05.476 --> 00:34:07.311
I don't remember if that was,
like, the full impetus for it,

00:34:07.311 --> 00:34:08.880
but, whenever, he got
banned by everybody,

00:34:08.880 --> 00:34:10.915
