00:34:26.130 --> 00:34:28.433
once Twitter, I think
Twitter did it first,

00:34:28.433 --> 00:34:30.601 align:start size:94% position:6%
then it was just the
signal to everybody else,

00:34:30.601 --> 00:34:31.969
