00:34:31.969 --> 00:34:32.904 align:start size:75% position:25%
Like now...
- Right, right.

00:34:32.904 --> 00:34:34.205
with the error, we took the hit,

00:34:34.205 --> 00:34:35.673
we did it,

00:34:35.673 --> 00:34:37.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
so, it's not a coordinated
