00:34:37.875 --> 00:34:39.110
that you're talking about,

00:34:39.110 --> 00:34:40.945
but it is, it's
some other level,

00:34:40.945 --> 00:34:43.147
related to fear
and manipulation,

00:34:43.147 --> 00:34:44.715 align:start size:84% position:16%
and how we all
operate, I suppose.

00:34:44.715 --> 00:34:45.516
- It's...

00:34:45.516 --> 00:34:46.751
Here's an analogy,

00:34:46.751 --> 00:34:47.919 align:start size:81% position:19%
an athlete gets
