00:34:47.919 --> 00:34:49.487 align:start size:88% position:13%
or some, you know,
horrible thing they did,

00:34:49.487 --> 00:34:51.022
and Nike drops 'em,

00:34:51.022 --> 00:34:53.624
and then, within an hour,
everybody else drops them.

00:34:53.624 --> 00:34:55.093
- [Dave] Yeah.

00:34:55.093 --> 00:34:56.160 align:start position:0%
- Now, I don't think Nike called
