00:34:56.160 --> 00:34:57.228
said "You gotta drop the guy."

00:34:57.228 --> 00:34:58.296
They all look around and go,

00:34:58.296 --> 00:35:00.698
"Well we better go, you know,

00:35:00.698 --> 00:35:02.200
what everybody, the
big guy's doin',

00:35:02.200 --> 00:35:04.802
and show our support for a
criticism of this athlete",

00:35:04.802 --> 00:35:06.504
or whatever it is.

00:35:06.504 --> 00:35:07.705
- What...

00:35:07.705 --> 00:35:09.173
So, part two of the way
you lay out the book

00:35:09.173 --> 00:35:11.309
is how to determine which
conspiracies are real.

00:35:11.309 --> 00:35:13.444 align:start size:97% position:3%
So we're, sort of, bouncing
around a lot of that,

00:35:13.444 --> 00:35:15.313
in the political sense.

00:35:15.313 --> 00:35:16.547
What about in just...

00:35:16.547 --> 00:35:18.082
And, let's get away from
