00:35:18.082 --> 00:35:19.183
just every other sense,

00:35:19.183 --> 00:35:21.886
there's aliens, and Area 51,

00:35:21.886 --> 00:35:24.355 align:start size:88% position:13%
and all the other
stuff that we're all...

00:35:24.355 --> 00:35:25.623
How do you figure
