they're always pronging people,

00:35:29.227 --> 00:35:30.261
and all that stuff.
(Michael chuckling)

00:35:30.261 --> 00:35:31.662
- Yeah.

00:35:31.662 --> 00:35:33.097 align:start size:97% position:3%
Right, so some of the
criteria I mentioned already,

00:35:33.097 --> 00:35:35.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, how many people
have to be involved,

00:35:35.199 --> 00:35:36.467 align:start size:84% position:16%
how many elements
have to come together,

00:35:36.467 --> 00:35:38.769
at just the right moment.

00:35:38.769 --> 00:35:39.704
How typical...

00:35:39.704 --> 00:35:42.073
How conspiracies really unfold,

00:35:42.073 --> 00:35:43.508
I went into detail,

00:35:43.508 --> 00:35:45.910 align:start size:97% position:3%
in that chapter on what
triggered the First World War,

00:35:45.910 --> 00:35:49.080
which was a group of
Serbian nationalists,

00:35:49.080 --> 00:35:50.414
called the Black Hand,

00:35:50.414 --> 00:35:54.418 align:start size:97% position:3%
who conspired to
assassinate Franz Ferdinand,

00:35:54.418 --> 00:35:56.787
the heir-apparent of the
Austria-Hungarian Empire,

00:35:56.787 --> 00:35:59.657
who was leaning on Serbia
to control them, and so on.

00:35:59.657 --> 00:36:00.992
So, this was a cabal, for sure.

00:36:00.992 --> 00:36:02.927 align:start size:88% position:13%
They met in secret,
they plotted for months,

00:36:02.927 --> 00:36:04.462
you know,

00:36:04.462 --> 00:36:05.963
each of the seven guys had
to go to a certain house,

00:36:05.963 --> 00:36:07.865
and give the code-word, and
then they get the weapon,

00:36:07.865 --> 00:36:10.168 align:start size:88% position:13%
a pistol or a
hand-grenade, and so on.

00:36:10.168 --> 00:36:12.270 align:start size:81% position:19%
And, and you know,
one guy didn't,

00:36:12.270 --> 00:36:13.204
he went to the wrong house,

00:36:13.204 --> 00:36:14.405
another guy chickened out,

00:36:14.405 --> 00:36:16.140
somebody else, you
know, got the weapon,

00:36:16.140 --> 00:36:18.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
but went to the wrong
place on the parade-route,

00:36:18.075 --> 00:36:19.610
where he was supposed to stand.

00:36:19.610 --> 00:36:21.112
And then, finally,

00:36:21.112 --> 00:36:23.080
some guy actually was able to
pull the pin on the grenade,

00:36:23.080 --> 00:36:26.717 align:start size:97% position:3%
and throw it, but it
bounced off the archduke's,

00:36:26.717 --> 00:36:28.152
the back of his car,

00:36:28.152 --> 00:36:29.554 align:start size:97% position:3%
rolled under the car behind
him and blew up there,

00:36:29.554 --> 00:36:31.756
and so these people
got hurt, "Oh no!"

00:36:31.756 --> 00:36:33.291
And then, the car zooms off,

00:36:33.291 --> 00:36:35.526 align:start size:97% position:3%
and he goes off to his little
meeting, gives a speech,

00:36:35.526 --> 00:36:38.029 align:start size:94% position:6%
says "Thanks a lot, I
come here to to Sarajevo,

00:36:38.029 --> 00:36:39.630
and you guys throw bombs at me."

00:36:39.630 --> 00:36:41.499 align:start size:84% position:16%
And then he leaves,
and then said,

00:36:41.499 --> 00:36:42.967
"Hey, we better go
back to the hospital,

00:36:42.967 --> 00:36:44.168
and check on our comrade."

00:36:44.168 --> 00:36:47.004 align:start size:88% position:13%
So the driver goes back
down the same road,

00:36:47.004 --> 00:36:48.606
that they were at,
and he turns right,

00:36:48.606 --> 00:36:51.776
on the Appel Quay,
the main drag, there,

00:36:51.776 --> 00:36:56.480 align:start size:97% position:3%
where the last conspirator,
this Gavrilo Princip,

00:36:56.480 --> 00:36:57.848
was sitting there, despondent,

00:36:57.848 --> 00:36:59.917
