his pocket, and he's like,

00:37:01.719 --> 00:37:03.888 align:start size:97% position:3%
"Well that was a big
fuck-up, nothing happened."

00:37:03.888 --> 00:37:06.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, all of a sudden,
here comes the car,

00:37:06.324 --> 00:37:07.858
and the car makes a wrong turn,

00:37:07.858 --> 00:37:08.960
and there was no reverse in it,

00:37:08.960 --> 00:37:10.228
so, the driver puts it neutral,

00:37:10.228 --> 00:37:12.763
and just backs up at,
like, one mile-an-hour,

00:37:12.763 --> 00:37:15.233 align:start size:84% position:16%
right in front of
this Gavrilo Princip,

00:37:15.233 --> 00:37:17.835
He's like, "Oh my
God!" Bam, dead.

00:37:17.835 --> 00:37:19.704 align:start size:88% position:13%
That's how these things
normally go, right?

00:37:19.704 --> 00:37:22.106
You know, I mean, Nixon,

00:37:22.106 --> 00:37:24.208 align:start size:88% position:13%
with the, you know,
the G-men, and the FBI,

00:37:24.208 --> 00:37:26.877
