Democratic hotel, at Watergate.

00:37:26.877 --> 00:37:27.712
(Dave chuckling)

00:37:27.712 --> 00:37:28.546
Right?

00:37:28.546 --> 00:37:29.981
- [Dave] Right.

00:37:29.981 --> 00:37:31.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
- I mean, again, if
those guys can't do it...

00:37:31.882 --> 00:37:35.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, by my example, that's
how things usually go.

00:37:35.186 --> 00:37:36.654
The more complex it has to be,

00:37:36.654 --> 00:37:38.556 align:start size:84% position:16%
the less likely
the theory is true.

00:37:38.556 --> 00:37:40.458
9/11 truth? Impossible.

