00:38:32.143 --> 00:38:33.811
You know, the bigger the effect,

00:38:33.811 --> 00:38:35.112 align:start size:84% position:16%
the bigger the
cause, to match it,

00:38:35.112 --> 00:38:36.280
or else, we...

00:38:36.280 --> 00:38:37.481 align:start size:84% position:16%
You know, just
doesn't feel right.

00:38:37.481 --> 00:38:39.850
So you get, you know,
