(Michael chuckling)

00:39:40.144 --> 00:39:41.746 align:start size:88% position:13%
And, you know, then
she ends up dead, so...

00:39:41.746 --> 00:39:42.947
- Yeah.

00:39:42.947 --> 00:39:44.415
- It just, sort of,
just sits there,

00:39:44.415 --> 00:39:45.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
