00:40:03.701 --> 00:40:04.969 align:start size:88% position:13%
we've told this story
once or twice, publicly,

00:40:04.969 --> 00:40:07.805
but, we were at, I
think, Arizona State.

00:40:07.805 --> 00:40:09.340
- Oh right.
