00:40:09.340 --> 00:40:11.175
if I'm not mistaken, we were
doin' a talk on free speech,

00:40:11.175 --> 00:40:13.911 align:start size:97% position:3%
and I, at the top of the
show, I say to the audience,

00:40:13.911 --> 00:40:15.379
I don't know, a couple
